finally <style=\"highlight\">lay Perseus to rest</style>.","source_cn":"等我带它回到呼临城，就可以开始为珀尔修斯<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BD99C8738D5C86A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521810005:1":{"text":"In Halian tradition, the belongings of the departed are buried with them. This shield will stay with Perseus forever, ensuring he rests peacefully in his eternal slumber...","source_cn":"按照呼临的传统，逝者生前用过的东西可以用来陪葬。它会陪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C76FA419583A07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521810006:0":{"text":"... Now we can go back and sign the truce.","source_cn":"……现在，我、我们可以回去签署停战合约了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF08737A82792D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521810007:0":{"text":"Good. You're not like those hotheaded warmongers from Halia.","source_cn":"很好。你和那些蠢笨的呼临好战者不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BDC8F62DCD9744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1521810007":{"text":"Good. You're not like those hotheaded warmongers from Halia.","source_cn":"很好。你和那些蠢笨的呼临好战者不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BDC8F62DCD9744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521810008:0":{"text":"Strength is a virtue.","source_cn":"强大的实力是优点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1C28DC2C17DC17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521810009:0":{"text":"But biting off more than you can chew? That's just foolish.","source_cn":"但不自量力，就是愚蠢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D222022380D3214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521810010:1":{"text":"I understand... No more fighting. I won't let Perseus' sacrifice be in vain.","source_cn":"我明白……不会再有战争了。我不会让珀尔修斯白白牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C2CF0462E7A4D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521810011:1":{"text":"Once the truce is signed, you're welcome to attend Perseus' funeral... if you'd like.","source_cn":"等停战合约签署后，如果你愿意，也可以来参加珀尔修斯的葬礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCF39654801744B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521810012:0":{"text":"No...","source_cn":"不可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE749646A618006FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521810013:0":{"text":"A truce is a truce. I'll admit he was a worthy opponent. But don't forget, he killed many Wildborn in his lifetime.","source_cn":"停战是停战，我承认珀尔修斯是合格的对手，但他也是雅库伯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E1A7D96379FD19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521810014:0":{"text":"We do not mourn our enemies. Take his shield. <style=\"highlight\">Let us return and sign the peace treaty.</style>","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人，不会参加仇敌的葬礼。带走他的盾牌。<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43FB39B8191CCFF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"The pot calling the kettle black...","source_cn":"你居然说别人好战？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E63D89848403FA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The pot calling the kettle black...","female":"The pot calling the kettle black...","variant_male_record_index":"79269","variant_female_record_index":"79270","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Don't the Wildborn usually like war?","source_cn":"好战者是指雅库伯尔人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F92ADF2E75FAF5C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't the Wildborn usually like war?","female":"Don't the Wildborn usually like war?","variant_male_record_index":"79271","variant_female_record_index":"79272","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"